<section class="hq-trap-section">
<div class="lf-h1">T 陷阱診斷專區</div>
<p>以下題目針對常見考試陷阱，做完即知你嘅陷阱弱項！共4題。</p>
<div class="lf-trap-section">
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P4-0101">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
