<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>43張</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「剩返加送走=原本」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P4-0102">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
