<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>12</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「乘嘅逆向係除」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P4-0103">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
